// `version = "1.2.300"` with an AU target is not an E1103 in this version: the limit of 255 for each part of AU is
// phase 2 (S-841, S-826). The only report is the E0200 of the `kind` (§15.3 `version` row, §14.3; S-580, S-841).

@export
pub flow voice(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample { x }
